    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given</p><p>(1) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>68</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>68</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p>(2) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant